  "description": "Want to get serious about road cycling? Our Vantage 1.0 is an amazing place to start. Carbon fork, disc brakes, and Shimano shifting really put it on the map.\nThe 6061 hydroformed alloy frame with internal headset and cables paired to a carbon aero through axle fork cuts a mean silhouette to match the high end performance.\nSmooth gear changes are guaranteed by Shimano Claris STI shifters and matched to Tektro disc brakes they give plenty of stopping power. Drivetrain comprises of a compact 50/34t forged crankset matched to a 12-32t making climbs a breeze and the flats fast.\nAll season tyres from Kenda ensure you stay glued to the road in whatever the weather throws at you and mounted to our Reid double wall disc rims the ride is both lively and well engineered.\nWant to start road cycling? Get yourself a Vantage!",
